sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 客户端
    participant R as RegisterView
    participant T as TokenObtainPairView
    participant J as SimpleJWT
    participant DB as User表
    C->>R: POST /api/auth/register (username, password)
    R->>DB: create(User, password=hash)
    R-->>C: 201
    C->>T: POST /api/auth/token (username, password)
    T->>J: authenticate()
    J->>DB: 校验凭据
    J-->>T: user
    T-->>C: access + refresh
    C->>C: 存储 refresh(内存/安全存储)
